Parse invoice test streams by their declared lengths

Respect PDF stream lengths and filters instead of matching binary contents
with newline delimiters. A trailing CR in a compressed checksum could be
consumed as CRLF and silently discard page one after the invoice date changed.

Exercise a deterministic CR-tail stream while retaining every invoice
snapshot assertion and reading actual page contents in page order.

